  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Kalanga Bible TranslationLukwalo gwakakwaligwa baHhebheru</book>
  <para style="ide">65001 - Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="rem">Copyright information. For any non-Paratext use of this text, permission must be obtained from the copyright holder.</para>
  <para style="h">BaHhebheru</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lukwalo gwakakawligwa BAHEBHRU</para>
  <para style="toc2">BaHhebheru</para>
  <para style="toc3">BaHhebh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lukwalo gwakakwaligwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bahhebheru</para>
  <para style="imt">Tjinginiso</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Lukwalo gwebaHhebheru</char> lukwalo gunokuludzila gulakidza kuti Yesu wakahhadzisa tjini bulebesambeli gwakalebgwa mutjibvumilano tjantolo. Gwakakwagwa sendebo inotugwa nensumikili. Kuna busupi gunoswika makumi matanhatu gunowanika mutjibvumilano tjantolo gunolakidza patjena kuti Yesu wakahhadzisa bulebesimbeli gwaka gwalebgwa nen'hingo weMphirisiti Nkulu wetjiJuta. Nentha yakoko lukwalo gwakakwaligwa kuludzila maKhirisitu etjiJuta. BaHhebheru golakidza kuti Yesu wakahhadzisa tjini Nlayo kuyetila kuti baphirisiti basitjapile mipilo yaka ipisiwa patjibeso. Yesu wakaba mpilo wakapiwa kuyetigwa matjinyo ose kan'ompela kuyetigwa zwibaka zose. MaKhirisitu mulubaka gwedu banotubula wana kuludzilo mulukwalo gwebaHhebheru kuti batobele Yesu Khirisitu ngobe ndiye unothama kuti kutubulike galabgwe muNdzimu, kakale tigalebgwe muwunli zwibaka zose (Bahheberu 12.2).</para>
  <para style="ip">Akuna unoziba kuti wakakwala baHhebheru ndiyani, koga bezwikwele banopa nkumbulo unoti pamwe ndimpositoli Phawuli, pamwe ndiLuka, kene Bhanabhasi. Gole lakakwagwa lukwalo igogu alitozibgwa banjinji banogalabwge kuti lukwalo igogu gwakakwagwa makole makumi anotendeka hule kwezwagwa kwaKhirisitu asanhu akapinda. Jerusalema lakapaladziwa mugole letjimakumi anotendeka hule kwezwagwa kwaKhirisitu, koga nkwali unolebeleka pehhugwi kweJerusalema senzi uyapo. BaHhebheru gwakakwagwa munzinkulu weRoma (13. 24) kakale lukwalo gwakabagwa mumakubungano manjinji ebagalimoyo beti bagubala begupindisila mbeli kulimwe gubungano lebagalimoyo</para>
  <para style="iot">Nlongonloso Yezwimukati</para>
  <para style="io1">Nkwali unolakidza kuti Yesu upehhugwi kwebalebesambeli beNdzimu nebatumwa (Bahhebheru 1.1-4 13).</para>
  <para style="io1">Unoyendela mbeli elakidza kuti Yesu upehhugwi kweba phirisiti bakabesumikila muthempeli yeNdzimu yaka ilimu Jerusalema (Bahhebheru 4.14-7 28).</para>
  <para style="io1">Kakale unolakidza kuti busumikili gwaYesu gupehhugwi kwetjibvumilano tjakatiwa neNdzimu nebanhu babe nenlayo wakatuliwa nemuna Mozisi (Bahhebheru 8. 1-10 31).</para>
  <para style="io1">Hule kwelakidza kuti Yesu upehhugwi muzila dzose, nkwali unobapa zila yabanofanila thama nayo zwinhu (Bahhebheru 10.32-13 17).</para>
  <para style="io1">Kwebupelo nkwali unopedzisila nekuludzila ehhalila lukwalo nebabuyisa (Bahhebheru 13.18-25).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s">Dama leNdzimu lihha ngeNkololo Uwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Ntolo Ndzimu wakalebeleka nabobatategulu bedu, lubaka gunjinji nangezila dzakasiyana ehingisa balebesambeli, <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />koga mumahhuba ano ebupelo watjilebeleka neswi ehingisa Nkololo uwe, iye waakagadza kuti abenghalinhaka wezwinhu zose, kakale wakabumba hango ehingisa iye. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Unolakidza gudzo leNdzimu, kakale utjiso tjitje, wakabhata zwinhu zose nedama lile linamasimba. Hule kwesuka matjinyo, wakagala kuludli gwa iye Wemasimba ose upehhugwi.<verse eid="HEB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bukulu gweNkololo weNdzimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Wakayetewa akaba nkulu pehhugwi kwebatumwa bekudzimu, ngobe zina laakawana igulugulu kwazo kupinda lebatumwa beNdzimu. <verse eid="HEB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Ngobe ndiwupi ntumwa wekudzimu, wakatongoyi neNdzimu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Iwe uNkololo wangu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">nasi ndabe Tate babo,”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 1:5" />
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Kakale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Ndowhoba Tate babe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">iye unowhoba Nkololo wangu.”<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Kakale ipapo ehhisa mbano iye muhango unoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">“Batumwa bose beNdzimu ngabawunamate.”<verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Nekwebatumwa unoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">“Unothama batumwa babe bakabe mhepo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">nebalanda babe unobathama bakabe bibi lemoto.”<verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Koga nekweNkololo unoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">“Tjigalo tjenyu tjeBumambo imwi Ndzimu tjiyapo nekusingapele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">swimbo yekululama ndiyoswimbo yebumambo gwenyu.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Makada kululama, mukabenga bubi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">Ndizo ke Ndzimu, iye Ndzimu wenyu wakamuhhodza nemafuta ekuhanha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">kupinda bakwinya benyu.”<verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Kakale unoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">“Imwi He pakutanga ndimwi makabumba hango,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">nekudzimu un'hingo wemaboko enyu.<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Kowhopalala, koga imwi mowhosala mulipo nekusingapele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">kose kowhohakala setjiyambalo.<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />Mowhokupeta sejila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">kowhobigwa ntome setjiyambalo tjisingatjambagwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">koga imwi mogala makajalo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">makole enyu atowhopela.”<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Ndiwupi ntumwa waka tongoyi neNdzimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">“Iwe gala kuluboko gwangu gweludli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">kudzina ndayeta zwita zwizo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">tjigalo tjemakumbo awo”?<verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Ngono batumwa bose abatameya dzinohingila Ndzimu, edzituma kuti dzibhatshe ibabo banowhowamutjila tjidziwa?<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s">Tjidziwa Kukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Ndizo ke takafanila bhatilila zwakasima pazwinhu zwatakawha, kuyetila kuti tisithewuke pazwili. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Ngobe hapa kuli kuti dama lakapiwa bobatategulu bedu ngebatumwa bekudzimu, lakalakalulama, bose basakalitobela kene bakaletjedza liwhilila bakawamutjila langiwa kwakafanila. <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />Ngono iswi towholeya langiwa tjini, hapa tisingawhilile tjidziwa kukulukulu zwingapa? Kwakalebgwa kutanga naHe, nayibabo bakawha elebeleka bakabvuma kutili kuti ilebeswa. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Ndzimu bo wakapa busupi ngezwilakidzilo, nemakaabadzo, nematjenamiso akasiyana siyana nangezwipo zweMeya Yakayengemala zwakakobewa kuyendidzana nekuda kukwe.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iye Unotitungamila Mukutjidziwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Ndzimu haazopa batumwa masimba kuti babe batongi behango inohha iyeyo yatinoleba nekwayo. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Selebgwa kwakunoyetiwa mudziwhalo kuyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">“Nhu ini, kumuli imwi Ndzimu, kunothama kuti mukumbule nekukwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">kene nkololo wenhu wamunotjengeta?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />Makawusa pasi kwebatumwa bekudzimu kwelubakanyana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">mukawumbadza tjiyala tjekudziwa nelemekedzewa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dzimwe whalo whulukugwi dzosa matama anoti. makawugadza pehhugwi kwemihingo yemaboko enyu</char></note>.<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />Makasa zwinhu zose kusi kwemakumbo awe.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Mukusa zwinhu zose pasi kukwe akuna Ndzimu tjaakasiya tjisipasi kwemasimba awe. Koga ke, kwangwenu atanhu tikabona zwinhu zose zwili pasi kukwe. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Koga tobona Yesu kwelubakanyana wakathamiwa akabe pasi kwebatumwa bekudzimu, ngwenu wakatjimbadziwa tjiyala tjekudziwa nelemekedzewa, ngobe wakadziyidziwa nelufu kuyetila kuti ngengoni dzeNdzimu afile banhu bose. <verse eid="HEB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Kwakakwakalulama kuti iye Ndzimu, iye kwakabva zwinhu zose, kakale zwibumbigwa iye kuti mukuhhisa bakololo banjinji mugudzo lile, waka akafanila thama kuti ntangisi wetjidziwa kwabo adziyile iko kwakathama akaba wakapelela.<verse eid="HEB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Unoyengemadza, nebanoyengemadziwa banobva mutshinde lin'ompela, ndizo ke Yesu aana honi kuti abadane eti makamu awe. <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />Unoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">“Ndowholeba zina lenyu kumakamu angu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">Ndowhomulumbidza pakati kwegubungano.”<verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />Unopamha eti “Ndowhogalabgwe kuNdzimu,” Unoti kakale, “Ndipano nebana bandakapiwa neNdzimu.”<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Ndizo ke saku bana bali belopa nenyama, Yesu wakaba nembumbiko iyeyo bo. Kuyetila kuti nelufu gugwe, apaladze iwhoyo unamasimba elufu iye Satane, <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />kakale asunungule bose ibabo baka bali balanda bupenyu gwabo gose nentha yehla kwabo lufu. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Kupatjena ke kuti iye waka esingabhatshe batumwa bekudzimu, koga waka ebhatsha zwizekugwana zwaAbhurahhamu. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Ikoku koleba kuti, waka efanila kuti abe semakamu awe nezila dzose, kuyetila kuti abe mphirisiti upehhugwi unangoni kakale egalikamoyo mukuhingila Ndzimu, kuyetila kuti abetjibhayilo tjesuka matjinyo ebanhu. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Nentha yekuti iye tjekukwe wakadziyila akalikiwa, unotubula bhatsha ibabo banolikiwa bo.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Unkulu Kupinda Mozisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Ndizo ke hama dzangu dzakayengemala, imwi munagobe mukudan'wa kwekudzimu, mu alakane mpositoli nemphirisiti nkulu webugalimoyo gwedu, iye Yesu. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Waka akagalikamoyo kuna iwhoya wakawunghadza, saMozisi bo waka akagalikamoyo mun'umba yeNdzimu. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Yesu unobagwa kuti unagudzo kupinda Mozisi sembaki wen'umba ekudziwa kupinda n'umba yaakabaka. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Ngobe imwe neyimwe n'umba inobakiwa nenhu, koga mbaki wako kose ndiNdzimu. <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Mozisi waka akagalikamoyo mun'umba yeNdzimu senlanda, epa busupi gwezwinhu zwaka zwiwholebgwa mulubaka gunohha. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Koga Khirisitu wakagalikamoyo kuti abe iye wakalinga mun'umba yeNdzimu senkololo. Naswi bo tin'umba iye, hapa tingabhatisisa mukuzwigalabgwe nezwida kunobva mukugalabgwe.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyaluluka kwebanhu beNdzimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Ndizo ke seleba kweMeya Yakayengemala iti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">“Nasi hapa muwha whi lile,<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />musisimise mimoyo yenyu sekwakayetika mupanduka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">muhhuba lelikiwa mutjilambanyika,<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />bobatategulu benyu pabakandilika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">nekene bakabona mihingo yangu kwemakole ali makumi mana.<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />Ndizo ke tjizekugwana itjetjiya ndakatjigwadziligwa ndikabe nditi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">‘Banogala belahika mumimoyo yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">kakale abazotongoziba zila dzangu.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Sekwandakatuna ndina buhongola nditi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">‘Abangatongofa bangina mukunyaluluka kwangu.’”<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Mutjenjele makamu angu, kuti pakati kwenyu kusiwanike nhu unamoyo wakayipa usina bugalimoyo, unomutungamilila kule neNdzimu unotjila. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Koga mukuludzililane hhuba limwe nelimwe hapa kutjayi “Nasi,” kuyetila kuti kusibe newun'ompela wenyu unobankukutu ngentha yetjengela kwejinyo. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Ngobe tina gobe munaKhirisitu, hapa takabhatilila mubugalibgwe gwedu gwekutanga kuswikila kubupelo.<verse eid="HEB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Sekwakunolebgwa kuyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">“Nasi hapa muwha whi lile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">musiwomese mimoyo yenyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">sekwakayetika nehhuba lamakapanduka.”<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Ndiboyani bakawha koga bakapanduka? Akuta ibo bose bakabva muIgipita betungamigwa naMozisi? <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Kakale ndiboyani Ndzimu baakagwadziligwa moyo kwemakole ali makumi mana? Akuta ibabaye baka betjinya, bakatjinyikila mutjilambanyika? <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Ndzimu wakatuna kuti ndiboyani basingowhongina mukunyaluluka kukwe, hapa kusi ibabo bakabesingawhilile? <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Ndizo ke tokubona kuti bakakon'wa ngina nentha yehaya bugalimoyo.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Sangwenu tjigadzabgwe tjengina mukunyaluluka kukwe tjitjiyapo, ayihleni ngobe kungaba newumwe pakati kwenyu unowanika nlandu wekon'wa swika mukunyaluluka ikoko. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Ngobe ndebo mbuya yakasumikigwa kutili sekwayakasumikigwa kubali bo, koga dama labakawha alizotongobatjidza, ngobe ibabo bakaliwha abazogalamoyo. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Ngobe iswi takagalamoyo tongina mukunyaluluka ikoko, seleba kukwe eti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">“Sekwandakatuna ndakagwadziwa moyo nditi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">‘Abatowhongina mukunyaluluka kwangu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Nekene mihingo iye yakayapelela kubvisila lubaka gwaakabumba hango. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Ngobe unapaakaleba nekwehhuba lebutondeka nezila iyeyi. “Ndzimu wakanyaluluka nehhuba lebutondeka mumihingo iye yose.” <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Ipapa ndebo iyeyi inolebgwa kakale kuyi, “Abatowhongina mukunyaluluka kwangu kene lini.” <verse eid="HEB 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Ndizo ke saku kutjiyapo kuti bamwe bangangina mukunyaluluka ikoko, kakale ibabo bakabudziwa ndebo mbuya kutanga bakakon'wa ngina nentha yesawhilila, <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />unobiga limwe hhuba kakale eti, “Nasi,” wakalebeleka ehingisa Davida kwapinda lubaka gulefulefu, sekwakunoleba lukwalo guti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">“Nasi hapa muwha whi lile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">musiwomese mimoyo yenyu.”<verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Ngobe kadzene Joshuwa waka abapa nyaluluka, hule kwelubaka Ndzimu waka esingowhoba aleba nekwelimwe hhuba. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Ndizo ke kobva kuti kutjina sabatha lenyaluluka kwebanhu beNdzimu; <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />ngobe kene yani unongina mukunyaluluka kweNdzimu, unonyaluluka bo mumihingo iye, sekwayetiwa neNdzimu mumihingo iye. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Ayitjigwisani nemasimba edu ose kuti tingine mukunyaluluka ikoko, kuyetila kuti kusibe nenhu unopalala nentha yesawhilila kwabo.<verse eid="HEB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Ngobe dama leNdzimu lotjila kakale lohinga, lopiza kupinda bhangatjeke linotjeka nentha mbili, lobhaya likadza likanopalalanya nkumbulo nemeya, nange panohangana mafupa nemongo, netonga mikumbulo nenjemulo dzemoyo. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Akuna tjembumbiko tjakasumbikika mbeli kwemeho awe, koga zwinhu zose zwipatjena kakale zwakanikiwa mbeli kukwe, iye watakafanila zwihandulila mbeli kukwe.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Mphirisiti Upehhugwi Kwazo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Saku tina mphirisiti nkulu upehhugwi wakapinda nekudzimu, iye Yesu Nkololo weNdzimu, ayibhatilileni mubugalimoyo gwedu gwatinoleba nemilomo yedu. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Ngobe atinaye mphirisiti upehhugwi usingatubule tiwhilangoni mukusasima kwedu, koga tinaye wakatongolikiwa bo nezila dzose saswi, koga iye esina jinyo. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Ngatisedzeleni patjigalo tjengoni tina kuzwigalabgwe, kuyetila kuti tiwamutjile mawhilangoni kakale tiwane ngoni dzinowhotibhatsha mulubaka gwatinoba tihaka lubhatsho.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Ngobe mphirisiti upehhugwi wose unohagwa pakati kwebanhu, unogadziwa kuti amilile banhu muna zwakalingisana neNdzimu epa zwipo nezwibhayilo zwematjinyo. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Unotubula bhata zwibuyanana ibabo basina luzibo kakale banolahika muzila, ngobe iye bo wakakombewa nebukuwa. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Ngentha yayikoku, wakafanila pila zwibhayilo zwematjinyo awe kose nezwibhayilo zwematjinyo ebanhu. <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Akuna unozwipa bugalo igogu guna gudzo kuti abe mphirisiti upehhugwi, koga unodan'wa neNdzimu, sekwakadan'wa Aroni.<verse eid="HEB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />NaKhirisitu bo azozwimilidza kuti abe mphirisiti upehhugwi, koga wakagadziwa nawhoya wakati kuwunli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">“Iwe ndiwe Nkololo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">nasi ndaba Tate babo.”<verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />Sekwaanoleba payimwe ndebo eti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">“Waba mphirisiti nekusingapele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">sekweludzi gwebuphirisiti gwaMelikhizedeki.”<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Mumahhuba awe etjila ali nhu Yesu waka etembezela nekumbilila ekuthama ngekuwa nange liga mihodzi kuna iye waka etubula wuntjidza mulufu, wakawhika ngentha yehla kukwe Ndzimu. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Nekene wakabe elinkololo weNdzimu wakazwidiya whilila kubvila mukudziyidzika kukwe, <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />wakati atjipelela nebuhhalo, akaba tshime letjidziwa kusingapele kuna bose banowuwhilila. <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />Ndzimu wakawunghadza kuti abe mphirisiti upehhugwi sekweludzi gwebuphirisiti gwaMelikhizedeki.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tjemegwa Nekwelaha Bugalimoyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Kuna kunjinji kwatingaleba nekwendebo iyeyi, iyo inolema tjenesewa kwayo, saku munonoka bhata zwinhu. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Ngobe nekene, kuwhoti lubaka igogu, mamatjifanila kuti mube matjiba badiyi, koga mutjahaka nhu unomudiya zwidiyo zwekutanga zwilelu zwedama leNdzimu. Mohaka nkaka kusi zodliwa zwakasima; <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />wose unotjila nenkaka haana luzibo gwedama lekululama ngobe utjiluhaba. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Zodliwa zwakasima ndezwebanhu bawhola, ndezwa ibabo, ngewolobela butjilo, bakatjidiya mikumbulo yabo palalanya tjibuya netjibi.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Ndizo ke ayiletjeni zwidiyo zwekutanga zwilelulelu zwebugalimoyo munaKhirisitu, tiyendilembeli nekula, tisingapamhe teya mbviwa dzehanduka tisiya mihingo yakafa negalamoyo muNdzimu, <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />nezwidiyo zwebvubikiwa, nebigiwa maboko, nemusiwa kwebafi, netongewa nekusingapele. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Whoku towhokuthama hapa Ndzimu atibvumila.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Ngobe akutotubulika handula kakale ibabo bakatongobona tjedza, bakalabila tjipo tjekudzimu, kakale bakaba negobe leMeya Yakayengemala, <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />bakalabila zipa kwedama leNdzimu nemasimba ezwibaka zwinohha, <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />kakale hapa bepanduka bebgwilila hule befupatila handuka kwabo, banobe bekowhomela Nkololo weNdzimu patjileyanyo kakale bewulengudza. <verse eid="HEB 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Ngobe minda yaguta vula inogala ina, ikoba nezwidlo zwinobhatsha ibabo bayinolimigwa, inowamutjila makombolelo anobva kuNdzimu. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Ngono hapa minda yomela mimhiwa nedihwa, ayitjina bhatsho kakale wabapedlo nelongwa bhiso, bupelo gwayo whuti upisiwe.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Nekene tileba zwedu tijali, tina bugalibgwe kuti imwi badikani kuna zwinhu zwihine zwakamulizana zwinohha netjidziwa kwenyu. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Ngobe akuta kuli kuti Ndzimu azolulama, kwekuti ungahayila hanya mihingo yenyu neludo gwamakalakidza kuwunli mukubhatsha bayengemali sekwamutjathama nangwenuwali zwako. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Toyemula kuti umwe newumwe wenyu alakidze zwipila iko zwako, kudzina kunoti kubupelo, kuyetila kuti tjamakalingilila tjihhadzisike, <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />kuti ndizo musibe banhu banabusimbe, koga muyedzelele ibabo kwakati ngemubugalimoyo, nangemoyonlefu bakadla nhaka yezwigadzabgwe.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malebeswa Etjigadzabgwe tjeNdzimu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Ngobe Ndzimu paakathama tjigadzabgwe kuna Abhurahhamu ngentha yekuti kwaka kusina umwe nkulu pawunli, Ndzimu wakatuna nezina lile. <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />Wakati, “Lebeswa ndowhokukombolela, ndikakupa bana banjinji.” <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Abhurahhamu wakati alinda ngemoyonlefu, akawamutjila tjaakabe agadziwabgwe. <verse eid="HEB 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Banhu banotuna behingisa zina lenhu unkulu pabali, tuna ikoko kolakidza kuti nhu unoleba lebeswa kakale kopedza kakabadzana kose kupakati kwabo. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Ndizo ke Ndzimu paaka ehaka lakidza patjena bagali benhaka yetjakagadziwabgwe nesahanduka kwembumbiko iye, wakatuna. <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Kuna izwezwi zwinhu zwibili zwisingake zwikahanduka, kakale Ndzimu zwaasingake akanyepa nekwazo, ndizo ke iswi takatihhila kudihhilo kuti tikulumbidzike kwazo tibhatilile kubugalibgwe gumbeli kwedu. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Tinako kugalabgwe ikoku semidzi yebutjilo gwedu yakasima isingazunguzike, kunongina mubugalo gwakayengemala gwemukati hule kwejila letjisitilo, <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />ikweno Yesu kwaakayendambeli akangina akamilila iswi, iye watjiba mphirisiti upehhugwi nekusingapele nekweludzi gwebuphirisiti gwaMelikhizedeki.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s">Mphirisiti Melikhizedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Melikhizedeki iwhoyu waka eli mambo wekuSalemu, kakale eli Mphirisiti upehhugwi weNdzimu Upehhugwi pehhugwi. Abhurahhamu wakati ebva kungwa kwaaka abulaya bomambo, Melikhizedeki wakawun'hanganidza akawunkombolela; <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />Abhurahhamu wakawumpa tjegumi tjakose kwaaka atola kungwa. Tjekutanga zina linoti Melikhizedeki lobva kuti “mambo wendulamo,” kakale kuti mambo wekuSalemu kobva kuti, “mambo wekunyalala.” <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Haana tatayi kene mayi, kene ludzi, haana panotangila mahhuba otjila kukwe kene bupelo gwebupenyu, unonga seNkololo weNdzimu, unogala elimphirisiti upehhugwi nekusingapele.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Tjikumbulani ke kuti waka eli nhu nkulu kungapani! Batategulu bedu Abhurahhamu bakawumpa tjegumi tjayiko kose kwabaka bawana kungwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Ibabo beludzi gwaLevi banoba baphirisiti, nlayo unoti bakafanila tola tjegumi kubva kubanhu, kumakamu abo, nenguba ibo bo bali beludzi gwaAbhurahhamu. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Koga iwhoyu nlume waka esiweludzi gwabo wakawamutjila tjegumi kubva kuna Abhurahhamu akawukombolela iwhoya waka enazwigadzabgwe. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Akuna angalamba kuti upasi unokombolegwa nenhu upehhugwi pawunli. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Ngekwapano tjegumi tjowamutjigwa nebanhu banofa, koga ngekwayeno tjowamutjigwa naye iwhoya kwakapiwa busupi nekukwe kuti unotjila. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Umwe angati Levi tjekukwe unowamutjila tjegumi, wakadusa tjegumi mukudusa kwaAbhurahhamu. <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />Ngobe Melikhizedeki paakahangana na Abhurahhamu iye waka esanhu azwagwa, waka etjimumbili wabatategulu babe.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Hapa kuli kuti lulama kwakakuhha ngebuphirisiti gwebaLevi (ngobe pasi pago banhu bakawamutjila nlayo) ngono kungentha yeni kwakahakika kuti kube newumwe mphirisiti unowhohha weludzi gwaMelikhizedeki, usi weludzi gwaAroni? <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Ngobe hapa buphirisiti guhandugwa, nlayo wakafanila handugwa bo. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Iye unolebegwa zwinhu izwezwi ndewegumwe ludzi, akuna weludzi gugwe wakatongohinga patjibeso tjepisila zwibhayilo. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Ngobe kunabusupi kuti He wedu wakazwagwa muludzi gwaJuda, Mozisi haana tjaakaleba nekweludzi igogu paaka eleba nekwebaphirisiti.<verse eid="HEB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umwe Mphirisiti wakafanana naMelikhizedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Ikoku kobapatjena hapa kwatjimuka umwe mphirisiti, unonga Melikhizedeki, <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />wakagadziwa kuti abe mphirisiti kusingatobegwe milayo yezwagwa kwenhu, koga kuhingisiwa masimba ebupenyu gusingapele. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Ngobe busupi nekukwe goti, “Nowhoba mphirisiti nekusingapele, nekweludzi gwebuphirisiti gwaMelikhizedeki.” <verse eid="HEB 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Nlayo nkulukugwi unosendekewa ntome, ngobe waka usina masimba, kakale usina bhatsho <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />ngobe nlayo awuna tjawakalulamisa, ngono ngwenu kugalabgwe kuhine kwatjihhisiwa, nayiko tosedzela pedlo neNdzimu.<verse eid="HEB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Kugalabgwe kuhine akuzohhisiwa koga kusina tuna, koga bamwe baphirisiti bakabegadziwa kusina tuna. <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />Koga iye wakaba mphirisiti ngetuna, Ndzimu paakati kuwunli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">“He watuna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">haangahandule nkumbulo uwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">‘Iwe nowhoba mphirisiti nekusingapele.’ ”<verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Ikoku ke koyeta Yesu akaba tjinosimisa tjibvumilano tjihine.<verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Baphirisiti bantolo baka bali banjinji, ngobe lufu gwakagubakonesa yendilambeli bali mun'hingo wabo. <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Koga iye unotjila tjoselele, ndizo ke n'hingo uwe webuphirisiti akuna ungawuntola. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Ndizo ke unotubula lubaka gose tjidza, kwazo kwazo ibabo banosedzela pedlo neNdzimu, bali muwunli, ngobe unotjila tjoselele kuti agale ebakumbilila.<verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Ngobe kwakakwakafanila kuti tibe neMphirisiti Upehhugwi wakajali, wakayengemala, usina nlandu, mbuyanana, wakathubukanyiwa nebatjinyi, wakamilidzigwa pehhugwi kwekudzimu. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Iye akutohakika kuti apile zwibhayilo mahhuba ose, eyetila matjinyo awe kutanga, ekotjiyetila matjinyo ebanhu, sebamwe baphirisiti bapehhugwi. Wakazwipila kan'ompela akaba tjibhayilo tjatjose. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Lebeswa, nlayo waka ugadza banhu kuti babe baphirisiti bapehhugwi mubukuwa gwabo, koga dama letuna lakahha hule kwenlayo, logadza Nkololo wakalulamisiwa kuti abe mphirisiti nekusingapele.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Mphirisiti Wedu Upehhugwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Tjikulu muna tjatinoleba ndiyetji, tina mphirisiti upehhugwi wakajalo iye ugele kuluboko gweludli gwetjigalo tjeMasimba ose kudzimu. <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />Unohinga ko mun'umba yakayengemala, ilo jatja lemalebeswa, lisakabakiwa nenhu, koga lakabakiwa naHe.<verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Mphirisiti upehhugwi wose wakagadziwa kuyetila kuti ape zwipo nezwibhayilo, ndizo ke mphirisiti nkulu iwhoyu unofanila ba netjimwe tjinhu tjaanopila. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Ngono kadzene aka ali muno muhango, waka esingawhobe mphirisiti ngobe bayapo baphirisiti banopa zwipo ngekwenlayo. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />N'hingo wabanothama pasi pano tjifananidzo nentuzi wezwikudzimu zwakayengemala; ngobe Mozisi, paaka abapedlo nebaka jatja wakalayiwa neNdzimu kuyi, “Iba nelebeswa kuti kose nokuthama utebela tjifananidzo tjawakalakidziwa ulipehhugwi kwedombo.” <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Koga ngwenuwali Khirisitu wakapiwa n'hingo wobuphirisiti uhine kwazo kupinda wabo, saku tjibvumilano tjaanolebelekela tjihine pana tjikulukugwi, ngobe tjibvumilano itjetji tjitshwa tjakabakiwa pehhugwi kwezwigadzabgwe zwihine.<verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Ngobe kadzene tjibvumilano tjekutanga tjakatjisina nlandu, koba kusakayetiwa tjimwe tjebubili. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Ngobe wakawana banhu babe nlandu paanoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">“Mahhuba anowhohha, kujalo He,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">pandinowhothama tjibvumilano tjitshwa nen'umba yaIsirayeli kakale nen'umba yaJuda.<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />Tjibvumilano itjetjo tjowhoba tjisakafanana netjandakathama nabobatategulu babo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">muhhuba landakababhata neluboko ndibatungamila ndibadusa muhango yeIgipita.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Ngobe abazoyendilambeli balimutjibvumilano tjangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">ndizo ke andizoba nehanya nabo, banojalo He.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Yetji nditjo tjibvumilano tjandinowhothama nen'umba yaIsirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">mumahhuba anohha, banojalo He.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">ndowhosa milayo yangu mumikumbulo yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">kakale ndowhoyikwala mumimoyo yabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Ndowhoba Ndzimu wabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">ibo banowhoba banhu bangu.<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Akuna unowhodiya umwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">kene hama iye eyibudza eti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">‘Ziba He,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">ngobe bose banowhondiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">kubva kuna upasi kunoti kuna upehhugwi.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Ndowhobayetila mazwibhatigwa matjinyo abo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">anditjowhokumbula milandu yabo.”<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Mukuleba nekwetjibvumilano tjitshwa, wakathama tjibvumilano tjekutanga tjikasaba nen'hingo. Ndizo ke tjisitjina n'hingo tjatjikwegula tjowhopela nekulibilidza.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s">Namata KwekuDzimu Nekwemuhango Ino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Kene itjo tjibvumilano tjekutanga tjaka tjina milayo yenamata kakale tjinabugalo gwakayengemala gwemuhango ino. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Kwaka kuna jatja lakabakiwa, laka lili lekutanga hapa ungina ubva kuhhe, mulili kwaka kuna tjigadziko tjinohomekewa zwivoneko, kwaka kuna dala laka lisiwa tjinkwa tjakayengemadziwa; bugalo igogu gwaka guyi Bugalo Gwakayengemala. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Hule kwejila letjisitilo kwaka kuna jatja linoyi Bugalo Gwakayengemala kupinda gose. <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Mulili kwaka kuna tjibeso tjezeezi tjepfungayidzila mhoza, nearika yetjibvumilano yaka yakadzulugwa nezeezi ntha dzose, muarika kwaka kuna hali yezeezi mukati kwayo ina mana, neswimbo yaAroni yaka isinila mahhani, nezwipivu zwemabgwe zwibili zwaka zwakakwagwa milayo. <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />Pehhugwi kwearika kwaka kuna makherubhimu egudzo mapapiro awo akafukidza tjigalo tjemawhilangoni, kunjinji nekwezwinhu izwezwi atingakulebe ngwenuwali.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Zwinhu izwezwi zwaka zwiti hapa zwabaakanyiwa nezila iyeyi, baphirisiti bakabengina tjoselele mujatja lekutanga benothama n'hingo wabo. <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />Koga mubugalo gobubili gumukati kwaka kungina mphirisiti upehhugwi koga kan'ompela pagole, waka engina akasenga malopa enowapila eyetila matjinyo awe, nematjinyo ebanhu. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Kubva munayikoku Meya Yakayengemala yaka ilakidza patjena kuti zila yengina muBugalo Gwakayengemala kupinda gose yaka isanhu ikahhulika, saku jatja lekutanga laka litjiyapo, <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />(ikoku kwaka kuli tjilakidzilo tjelubaka gwangwenuwali). Nekwendongoloso iyeyi zwipo nemibhayilo yemhuka kwakakupiwa kuNdzimu kwaka kusingatubule tjenesa hana yenhu unonamata. <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />Koga kwaka kuhinga ngezodliwa nezwinon'wiwa koga, nemilenje yengudza mbili, ili milayo yaka ili yakuhhe kwembili wenhu koga, kudzina kunoti lubaka Ndzimu athama zwinhu nezila tshwa.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Koga Khirisitu wakati atjihha semphirisiti upehhugwi wezwinhu zwakanaka zwakatjihha, wakangina mujatja gulu kakale lakayetiwa likapelela, (lisakathamiwa ngemaboko ebanhu, kuleba kuti alita lembumbiko iyeyi) <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />wakangina kan'ompela muBugalo Gwakayengemala akasipamhe kakale, asakasenga malopa embudzi neemhulu, koga ngelile lopa akatiwanila sunungugwa kusingapele. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Ngobe hapa nyasiwa kwebanhu banahambgwa ngemalopa embudzi neemikono nenlota wemholombe kwakakubayengemadza kuyeta kuti mibili yabo itjene, <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />ngono malopa aKhirisitu, iye wakazwipila ngeMeya isingapele asinanlandu kuNdzimu unowhodzitjenesa kungapani hana dzenyu kuti dzibve kumihingo inokwebela kulufu, kudze dzihingile Ndzimu unotjila.<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Ndizo ke Khirisitu ndiye nyayi wetjibvumilano tjitshwa, kuyetila kuti ibabo bakadan'wa bawamutjile nhaka isingapele yakagadziwabgwe, saku kwakaba nefa kwakabasunungula kumatjinyo pasi kwetjibvumilano tjekutanga.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Ngobe pana lukwalo gwekoba nhaka, hapa wakagukwala atjifa, kwakafanila kuti kube nebusupi kuti wafa kwelebeswa. <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />Ngobe lukwalo gwekoba nhaka gohinga hapa wakagukwala atjifa, agutohinga hapa wakagukwala atjimpenyu. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Ndizo netjibvumilano tjekutanga bo atjizotongohinga kusina tebugwa kwemalopa. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Ngobe Mozisi wakati atjibudza banhu bose milayo yose, wakatola malopa emhulu neembudzi, akahanganyiwa nevula akanyasa lukwalo kan'ompela nebanhu ehingisa wulu haba yakabhayigwa paluhanga gwehhayisopi, <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />eti, “Ileli ndilo lopa letjibvumilano Ndzimu tjaakamulaya nekwatjo.” <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Nezila iyo zwayo wakanyasa nemalopa jatja nezwidla zose zwaka zwihingisiwa mukunamata. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Lebeswa, pasi kwenlayo zwinhu nebunji gwazo zotjenesewa nemalopa, hapa kusina tebugwa kwemalopa akuna yetigwa mazwibhatigwa kwematjinyo.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tjibhayilo tjaYesu Tjosuka Matjinyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Ndizo kwakakwakafanila kuti mifananidzo yezwinhu zwikudzimu zwitjenesewe nemilenje iyeyi, koga zwinhu zwikudzimu tjekwazo zwitjenesewa nezwibhayilo zwihine kupinda izwezwi. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Ngobe Khirisitu azongina mubugalo gwakayengemala gwakabumbiwa nemaboko, gunoba tjifananidzo tjeguyapo gwakwako, koga wakangina kudzimu ntja sangwenuwali weetimila mbeli kweNdzimu. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Aazongina kudzimu kuti anozwipila epamhulula, sekwakunoyetiwa nemphirisiti upehhugwi engina muBugalo Gwakayengemala gole negole akasenga malopa asi awe. <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />Hapa kwakajalo waka ewhodziyila epamhulula kanjinji kubvila pakubumbiwa kwehango. Koga sangwenu wakahha kan'ompela koga mulubaka gobupelo kudze aduse jinyo nekuzwipila kukwe iye. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Ngobe senhu wose ewhofa kan'ompela, hule kwayikoko kotobela tongewa, <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />ndizo Khirisitu wakayetiwa tjibhayilo kan'ompela, kuti asenge matjinyo ebanjinji, unowhobonekwa gwebubili, esingabinge whodusa matjinyo koga ewhotjidza ibabo bakawunlindila.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Ngobe nlayo waka ulintuzi wezwinhu zwaka zwihha, usimbumbiko yazo yakwako. Ndizo nlayo ngezwibhayilo izo zwazo zwinopigwa tjoselele gole negole, awungatongothama banhu banosedzela kuNdzimu kuti bapelele. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Kadzene banhu banonamata Ndzimu bakatjenesewa kubva mumatjinyo tjose kan'ompela, banoba basakazwibona nlandu ngentha yematjinyo abo, zwibhayilo zose zoba zwakama pigwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Koga zwibhayilo izwezwi zwikumbuludzo zwematjinyo gole negole. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Ngobe akutoyetika kuti malopa emikono nembudzi aduse matjinyo.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Nentha yayikoku Khirisitu wakati ahha muhango akati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">“Amutohaka zwibhayilo nemipilo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">koga makandibaakanyila mbili,<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />amutohanhisiwa nemipilo inopisiwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">nemipilo yematjinyo.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Ndakakotjiti, ‘Imi ndahha kuti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">ndiwhothama kuda kwenyu, imwi Ndzimu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">sekwakakwagwa nekwangu mulukwalo.’ ”<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Kutanga waka eleba eti, “Amuzotongohaka zwibhayilo nemipilo inopisiwa nemipilo yematjinyo, kene iko hanha nekwayo” (nekene kwaka kupigwa kutobegwa nlayo), <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />wakapamha eti, “Imi ndahha kuti ndiwhothama kuda kwenyu.” Unodzima kwekutanga eyetila simisa kwebubili. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Ngekuda ikoko takatjenesewa ngepigwa kwembili waYesu Khirisitu kan'ompela tjatjose.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Mahhuba ose mphirisiti umwe newumwe unothama n'hingo uwe, epila zwibhayilo zwakafanana epamhulula, zwisingake zwikadusa matjinyo. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Koga Khirisitu wakati apila tjibhayilo tjin'ompela tjelubaka gose tjematjinyo, wakagala pasi kuluboko gweludli gweNdzimu, <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />akamilila kudzina babengi babe bayetiwa tjigalo tjemakumbo awe. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Nentha yempilo un'ompela wakalulamisa tjatjose ibabo bakatjenesewa.<verse eid="HEB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Meya Yakayengemala inopa busupi gwayo kutili iti,<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />“Itjetji nditjo tjibvumilano tjandinowhothama nabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">hule kwemahhuba iyawo, kujalo He,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">ndowhosa milayo yangu mumimoyo yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">ndoyikwala mumikumbulo yabo.”<verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Kakale unokotjiti, “Anditowho alakana matjinyo abo nebubi gwabo.” <verse eid="HEB 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Hapa kwatjiyetigwa mazwibhatigwa matjinyo akutjahakika mpilo unodusa matjinyo.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayisedzeleni Pedlo NeNdzimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Ndizo ke, makamu angu, saku tina kuzwigalabgwe kwakasima kuti tingangina mubugalo gwakayengemala ngemalopa aYesu, <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />nezila tshwa kakale ilizila mhenyu yaakatihhulila nemujila letjisitilo, kuleba kuti ngemumbili uwe, <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />kakale saku tina mphirisiti unkulu unotungamila n'umba yeNdzimu, <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />ngatisedzeleni pedlo tina mimoyo inamalebeswa nebugalimoyo guhhele, nemimoyo yedu yakanyasiwa ikatjena kubva kumikumbulo mibi nemibili yedu yakasukiwa nevula mbuyanana. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Ayibhatilileni mukugalabgwe kwatinoleba tisingazunguzike, ngobe iwhoya wakatigadzabgwe unogalikamoyo. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Kakale ngati alakane kuti tingakuludzilana tjini, kuti tidanane tithame mihingo yakanaka, <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />tisingaletje kubungana panhu pan'ompela, senlenje webamwe, koga tikuludzilana, kakale tikuwaze sangwenu mubona kuti Hhuba lasedzela.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Ngobe tikatjinya kamwaza hule kwewamutjila luzibo gwemalebeswa akutjina tjimwe tjibhayilo tjematjinyo, <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />tjasala whumilila tongewa kunowhohha kunohlisa nemoto unohlisa unowhopaladza bose babengi. <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Nhu waka etjuluka nlayo waMozisi waka ebulawa kusina whigwa ngoni, hapa basupi babili kene batatu bapa busupi gunofanana. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Ngono kowhoba kungapani langiwa kwenhu unolingila pasi Nkololo weNdzimu, unosa hambgwa lopa letjibvumilano laakatjenesewa nalo, unogwadzisa Meya yengoni? <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Ngobe towunziba iye wakati, “Bgwilizila ndekwangu, ndowhobgwilizila,” kakale ekaba eti, “He unowhotonga banhu babe.” <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Itjinhu tjinohlisa kwazo kwazo kuti nhu awile mumaboko eNdzimu unotjila.<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Kumbulani mahhuba akapinda, hule kwekuti tjedza tjavoneka mumuli, makasimidzila mungwa yakabangalala yemamanikano, <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />gumwe lubaka mutukwa pakati kwebanhu kakale mubhakhwa zwakayipa, gumwe lubaka, nemwibo muzwipila bapanhu pan'ompela nebanobhakhwa sayikoko. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Ngobe makaba nemawhilangoni kubasungwa, kakale tolegwa nhundu dzenyu ngemasimba makakuwamutjila ngekuhanha, ngentha yekuti makamuziba kuti imwi munako kuhine kunogala nekusingapele. <verse eid="HEB 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Ndizo ke musilahikigwe nezwigalabgwe kwenyu ngobe kunambhayilo nkulunkulu. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Ngobe kohakika kuti musimidzile, kuyetila kuti muthame kuda kweNdzimu mukowamutjila tjaakagadzabgwe. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Seleba kwelukwalo guti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">“Kwasala lubaka guhomanana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">iwhoyo unohha unowhohha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">atowhononoka;<verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Wakalulama wangu unowhotjila nekugalamoyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">koga hapa ebgwilila hule,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">meya yangu ayitowhohanha nekukwe.”<verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Koga atita ibabo banobgwilila hule benopaladziwa, koga tiibabo bana kugalamoyo kakale banotjengeta meya dzabo.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s">Bugalimoyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Bugalimoyo whuba nelebeswa kuti zwinhu zwatakalingilila kuti zwiyetike zowhoyetika, whugalabgwe muzwinhu zwisingabon'we nemeho. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Ngentha yeba nekugalamoyo banhu bantolo bakawamutjila lebgwa zwakanaka kwakayengemala.<verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Ngegalamoyo tokuwhisisa kuti hango yakabumbiwa ngedama leNdzimu, kuyetila kuti zwinhu zwinobon'wa nemeho zwakabumbiwa zwibva muzwinhu zwisingabon'we.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Ngebugalimoyo Abheli wakapila kuNdzimu tjibhayilo tjinowamutjilika kupinda tjaKhayini. Ngekugalamoyo ikoku waka lebgwa zwakanaka kuti wakalulama, Ndzimu epa busupi ngewamutjila zwipo zwizwe; iye wakafa, koga ngegalamoyo kukwe utjalebeleka nanasi.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Ngekugalamoyo Inoki wakatogwa akayenda pehhugwi kuyetila kuti asilabile lufu. “Azotongowanika, ngobe wakatogwa neNdzimu.” Asanhu akatogwa, kwakaba nebusupi gunoti waka ehanhisa Ndzimu. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Pasina bugalimoyo akutotubulika hanhisa Ndzimu. Ngobe kene yani zwe unohaka sedzela kuNdzimu unofanila galamoyo kuti Ndzimu uyapo, kakale kuti unopa mbhayilo ibabo banowun'haka.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Ngekugalamoyo Nowa wakati atjenjedzewa neNdzimu nekwezwinhu zwinowhohha mulubaka gunohha esanhu ekazwibona, wakawhilila akabaakanya kepe eyetila tjidza n'ha uwe wose; nethama ikoku wakawana hango nlandu, akaba nghalinhaka yendulamo inohha ngekugalamoyo.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Ngekugalamoyo Abhurahhamu wakawhilila paakabudziwa kuti ayende kuhango yaaka ewhowamutjila senhaka, wakayenda koga asingazibe kuti unoyenda poni. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Ngekugalamoyo wakanogala muhango yaaka akagadziwabgwe sentaya, wakagala mumajatja naIsaka naJakobe bagalinhaka kan'ompela naye betjigadzabgwe itjo zwatjo. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Ngobe waka akalindila nzi-nkulu unambviwa, wakabambiwa ukabakiwa neNdzimu.<verse eid="HEB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Ngekugalamoyo Sara tjekukwe wakawamutjila masimba ebhata mimba, nekene waka atjikwegula, kuyetiwa nekuti waka eti iwhoya wawumpa tjigadzabgwe unogalikamoyo. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Ndizo ke kubva kunlume un'ompela, waka enga nhu wakafazwe, kwakazwagwa zwizekugwana zwinjinji senyenyedzi dzikumakole, kakale zwili zwinjinji sensetje wegungwa usingabalike.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Bose ibaba bakafila mubugalimoyo, baka basanhu bakawamutjila zwakagadziwabgwe, koga bakabazwibona bakazwihanhila zwitjikulekule, kakale bakabvuma kuti ibo bataya kakale bahhi muhango. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Ngobe banhu banoleba zwinhu zwakajali, banokusa patjena kuti ibo banohaka yabo hango. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Hapa kuli kuti baka begala bekumbula hango iyeya yabakabva kuyili, banoba bakawana nkoba webgwilila kuyili. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Koga sekwakuli iko banohaka hango imbuya, kuleba kuti, hango yekudzimu. Ndizo ke Ndzimu haana honi kuti adan'we kuyi iye ndiye Ndzimu wabo, ngobe wababaakanyila nzi-nkulu.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Ngekugalamoyo Abhurahhamu paakaholesesewa, wakapila Isaka setjibhayilo. Iye waka awamutjila zwigadzabgwe, waka atjizwilulamisila kuti apile nkololo uwe un'ompela. <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />Nekene Ndzimu waka ati kuwunli, “Zwizekugwana zwawunowhoba nazo zowhobva munaIsaka.” <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Wakagalamoyo kuti Ndzimu waka etubula musa kene bafi, ndizo nedzimwe zila, wakawamutjila Isaka kakale amusiwa kubafi.<verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Ngekugalamoyo Isaka wakakombolela Jakobe naEsawu pehhugwi kwezwinhu zwinohha.<verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Ngekugalamoyo Jakobe abapedlo nefa wakakombolela bakololo baJosefa bose, enamata akanayila pehhugwi kweludozo gugwe.<verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Ngekugalamoyo Josefa wakati abapedlo nefa, wakaleba ngekwefuluka kwebaIsirayeli bebva kuIgipita akalaya kuti abiganyiwe tjini.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Ngekugalamoyo pakazwagwa Mozisi bazwadzi babe bakawusumbika kwemimwedzi mitatu, ngobe bakababona kuti waka eli mwana wakanaka kwazo; bakabesingahle tjuluka nlayo wamambo.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Ngekugalamoyo Mozisi wakati akula akalamba dan'wa eyi unkololo wenkololokadzi waFaro. <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />Wakahala bhakhwa zwakayipa panhu pan'ompela nebanhu beNdzimu, pana kuti azwihanhise nejinyo kwelubakanyana. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Wakakutola nezila inoti, bhakhwa zwakayipa udziyidziwa nentha yaKhirisitu, kuna tjilemela tjikulu kupinda fumwa yeIgipita, ngobe waka akalinga kumbhayilo unowhohha.<verse eid="HEB 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Whugalamoyo kwakayeta Mozisi akabva kuIgipita esigahle buhongola gwamambo, ngobe wakasimidzila sekunoyi unobona iwhoya usinga bon'we. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Ngekugalamoyo wakalondolodza Phasika akanyasa malopa, eyetila kuti Mpaladzi wembano asitongogala akunha mbano dzemaIsirayeli.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Ngekugalamoyo banhu bakatjuluka Gungwa Haba sekunoyi banoyenda pehhugwi kwemavu akawoma; koga maGipita pabakayedza thama bo sayikoko, bakasengwa negungwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Ngekugalamoyo makuma eJerikho akawa, hule kwepotelekwa kwemahhuba alikutondeka. <verse eid="HEB 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Ngekugalamoyo Rahhabhu fukula ngentha yekuti wakawamutjila zwakanaka whodzi aazobulawa panhu pan'ompela nebanhu baka besingawhilile.<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Ndingaleba kumwe kupi? Ngobe lubaka gungahayika kuti ndilebe nekwaGidiyoni, naBharakhi, naSamusoni, naJefutha, naDavida, naSamuyeli nebalebesambeli. <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />Ibo bakati ngekugalamoyo, bakakunda bumambo, bakathama kuti kululama kubeyapo, bakawamutjila zwigadzabgwe, bakahhalila milomo yehumba, <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />bakadzima moto unopfuta, bakadzeta bhangatjeke, bakasimisiwa nengube baka bena bukuwa, bakasima mungwa, bakayeta kuti bagwi banjinji bebataya batihhe. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Banhu betjikadzi bakawamutjila makamu abo aka afa ngemusiwa kubafi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 11:35">Bamwe bakambumugwa belamba sunungugwa beyetila kuti bawane butjilo guhine hule kwemusiwa kubafi. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Bamwe bakakuwelegwa bakalobgwa kose nesungwa nemaketane, nehhaliligwa mumajele. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Bakaphobogwa nemabgwe, bakatjekewa bakapalugwa pakati, bakabulawa nebhangatjeke, bakadzungayila bakambala makukuta emhwizi neembudzi, besina kene tjabo, begwadzisiwa, bebhakhwa zwakayipa, <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />hango yaka isakabalizana, baka bedzungayila mugwenga, nemumatombo, bebgwata mumakuwhu, nemumimwina yapasi.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Bose ibaba nekene bakalebgwa zwakanaka ngentha yebugalimoyo gwabo koga abazowamutjila tjakagadziwabgwe. <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />Ngobe Ndzimu waka atjitibaakanyila kale tjimwe tjinhu tjihine kuti basitongothamiwa bakapelela basina iswi.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s">Ndzimu ndiTate Bedu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Ngono sayikoku takakombeledzewa nebasupi banjinji zwingapa, ayilaheni mitolo yose, nejinyo lakatikwakwatila, tilabuke tjintangentange tjatili mutjili nekuzwipila, <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />takalinga kuna Yesu, ntangisi nenlulamisi webugalimoyo gwedu, iye ngentha yehanha kwaka kuli mbeli kukwe wakadzikitidzila tjileyanyo, esina hanya nelengudziwa, ugele kuluboko gweludli gwetjigalo tjebumambo tjeNdzimu.<verse eid="HEB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Kumbulani iye wakasimidzilila dziyidziwa nebatjinyi kungapa, kuyetila kuti imwi musinyale kene pela simba. <verse eid="HEB 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Mukugwisana kwenyu nejinyo, amanhu mukagwa kuswikila patebugwa kwemalopa enyu. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Kene matjikangan'wa kuludzigwa kwamunoyetiwa neNdzimu elebeleka nemwi sebakololo? Eti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">“Nkololo wangu usikutole setjinhu tjisina n'hingo hapa utjemegwa naHe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">kakale usinyale moyo hapa ekulanga.<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Ngobe He unotambunudza waanoda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">kakale unolanga zwakasima wose nkololo waanowamutjila.”<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Dzikitidzilani tambunudziwa, Ndzimu unomubhata sebakololo babe; ndiwupi nkololo usingatjemegwe natate babe? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Hapa musiyiwa musatambunudziwa, ibo bamwe bose batambunudziwa, kobva kuti amuta bana bamunlayo, amuta bakololo. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Pehhugwi kwayikoku, tinabotate bedu bemuhango ino ibo banotitambunudza tibawhilila. Ngono atingazwitebamise kuna Tate bemeya tikatjila? <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Ngobe ibo baka betitambunudza kwelubakanyana, sebona kwabo, koga iye Ndzimu unotitambunudza kuyetila kuti kutilulamile, kudze tihanganyile nebuyengemali gugwe. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Mulubaka utjatambunudziwa koba kugwadza kusingahanhise, koga hule kwayikoko kozwala mitjelo yekunyalala yendulamo kuna bose bakadiyiwa ngetambunudziwa.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Layiwa neTjemegwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Ndizo ke simisani maboko enyu akalembeleka nezwibvi zwenyu zwinabukuwa. <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />Mubaakanyile makumbo enyu zila dzakatambunuka, kuyetila kuti tjinohudza tjisinyele koga tjipole.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Gwisani kuti mugale nekunyalala nebanhu bose, mutjile butjilo gwakayengemala, ngobe kuhhe kwayikoku akuna nhu unowhobona He. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Mubone kuti pakati kwenyu akuna unokon'wa wana ngoni dzeNdzimu; kuyetila kuti kusibe nendzi unobaba unomela ukosilinga nebhoma hambgwa banjinji. <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />Ngakusibe nenhu unothama bupombgwe pakati kwenyu, kene usingahle Ndzimu saEsawu, iye wakatengesa fanilo iye, fanilo yebambano yegala nhaka, ngendilo yezodliwa. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Ngobe moziba kuti hule kwayikoko, ohaka kuti atole makombolelo wakalambiwa, ngobe nenguba waka ohaka makombolelo iyawo nemihodzi kwaka kusitjina zila yekuti iye angahanduka tjini.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Imwi amuzohha kutjinhu tjingabhakhwa nemaboko, kumoto unopfuta, nehhalima, nebhulubusi, nedutu, <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />nenlilo welunyanga newhi lakaleba matama akata kuti bakaliwha bakumbilisise kuti kusitjabe nelimwe dama linolebgwa kubali. <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />Ngobe bakalemegwa nenlayo waka uti, “Kene iyo mhuka ikakunha dombo yakafanila khikitidziwa nemabgwe.” <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Tjakabon'wa ipapo tjakatjihlisa kwazo, Mozisi akadza akati, “Ndotetema ngentha yehla.”<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Koga mahha kudombo leZiyoni nekunzi-nkulu weNdzimu unotjila, Jerusalema lekudzimu lina zwiwulu zwinjinji zwebatumwa bekudzimu bakakubungana bakahanha, <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />nekugubungano lembano, dzina mazina akakwagwa kudzimu, nekuntongi, iye Ndzimu wayibo bose, nekumeya dzebanhu bakalulama bakayetiwa bakaba bakapelela, <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />nekuna Yesu, nyayi wetjibvumilano tjitshwa, nekulopa lakanyasiwa, linolebeleka zwinhu zwihine kupinda lopa laAbheli.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Ibani nelebeswa kuti amutolamba whilila iye unolebeleka. Ngobe hapa basakasubvunuka pabakawunlamba iye wakabatjemela ipapa muhango, ngono iswi tinga subvunuka kene, hapa tiwunlamba iye unotitjemela alikudzimu? <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Lubaka igogo whi lile lakalizunguza hango; koga ngwenu wakatigadzabgwe eti, “Ndowhopamha kakale, ndisingazunguze hango yoga, koga nekudzimu bo.” <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Dama linoti, “Ndowhopamha kakale,” lobva dusiwa kwezwinhu zwinozunguziwa, zwinhu zwakabumbiwa, kuyetila kuti zwisingazunguzike zwisale.<verse eid="HEB 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Ndizo ke ngatibokeni kuti takawamutjila bumambo gusingake gukazunguzika, tinamate Ndzimu nezila inowamutjilika nekuzwitebamisa nehla. <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />Ngobe Ndzimu wedu umoto unopaladza.<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s">Ungahanhisa Ndzimu Tjini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Yendilanimbeli mudana sehama. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Mube nelebeswa kuti mowamutjila bezi banopinda ngezila ina bunhu. Ngethama ikoku, bamwe bakawamutjila batumwa bekudzimu zwakanaka basingazibe kuti banowamutjila batumwa bekudzimu. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Mukumbule bamumajele, sekunonga kunoyi makasungwa panhu pan'ompela nabo, nebanobhakhwa zwakayipa sekunoyi namwi bo mobhakhwa zwakayipa.<verse eid="HEB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Bose banhu ngabalemekedze ndobolo, nhobo yendobolo ngayisilongwe hambgwa, ngobe Ndzimu unowholanga banothama bupombgwe nebasingazwibhate.<verse eid="HEB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Tjengetani butjilo gwenyu gusilawugwe neludo gwemari, gutshikanani nekose kwamunako, ngobe iye unoti, “Anditowhobva pakuli, anditowhokusiya.” <verse eid="HEB 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Ndizo ngekuzwigalabgwe tingaleba titi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">“He ndiye mbhatshi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">anditowhohla;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">ini nhu tjaangandithama?”<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Kumbulani nekwebatungamili benyu, ibabo bakasumikila dama leNdzimu kumuli, mulingisise tjila kwabo, mutodze bugalimoyo gwabo. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Yesu Khirisitu ndiyezwe wahhulo, nanasi nekusingapele. <verse eid="HEB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Musitungamiligwe ntome nezwidiyo zwakasiyana siyana zwisakawolobeleka, ngobe kwakanaka kuti moyo usimisiwe nengoni, usi simisiwe nezodliwa, zwisakabhatsha ibabo bakabekutobedzela.<verse eid="HEB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Tina tjibeso tjepisila zwibhayilo, ibabo banohinga pajatja<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pathebhenekili </char><char style="fp" closed="false" /></note> abatobvumigwa dla mipilo patjili. <verse eid="HEB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Ngobe mitumbi yemhuka idzedzo dzinamalopa anohhisiwa paBugalo Gwakayengemala kupinda gose nemphirisiti upehhugwi tjili tjibhayilo tjejinyo inopisigwa kuhhe kwenzi. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />NaYesu bo wakafila kuhhe kwenzi-nkulu, kuyetila kuti atjenese banhu ngemalopa awe. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Ndizo ke ayiyendeni kuwunli kuhhe kwenzi, tisenge bo bhakhwa zwakayipa kwaakasimidzila mukuli. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Ngobe pano muhango atina nzi-nkulu unowhobayapo nekusingapele, koga tohaka nzi-nkulu unohha. <verse eid="HEB 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Nemuwunli ayigaleni tipa mipilo yelumbidza Ndzimu, kunoba mitjelo yemilomo yedu inobvuma zina lile. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Mubenelebeswa kuti mothama tjakanaka nange kobelana kwamunako, ngobe zwibhayilo zwakajali zohanhisa Ndzimu.<verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Muwhilile batungamili benyu, muzwitebamise pasi kwabo, ngobe banolisa meya dzenyu, saku bewhotula nlondesedzo. Mubabvumile bathame n'hingo nekuhanha, basiwuthame balihhele buyendasi ngobe koba kusingowhomubhatsha netjimwe.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Mutitembezelele, ngobe tinalebeswa kuti tinahana mbuyanana, toyemula yeta zwakanaka muna kose. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Ndomukumbilisisa kuti mukuthame ikoku kuyetila kuti Ndzimu andibgwilize kumuli nekutjimbidza.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntembezelo wohhalila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Kadzene Ndzimu wekunyalala iye wakamusa He wedu Yesu kubafi, iye nlisi nkulu wemwizi, ngemalopa etjibvumilano tjisingapele, <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />angamupa kose kwakanaka kuyetila kuti muthame kuda kukwe, ehinga mumuli itjetjo tjinohanhisa mbeli kukwe, ngemuna Yesu Khirisitu. Ngaakudziwe lini nalini. Akujalo.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matama ebupelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Ndomukumbilisisa makamu angu amutjilani nemoyonlefu dama langu lemukulumbidza, ngobe ndamukwalila ngekufutshwanana. <verse eid="HEB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Mofanila whisisa kuti gamu ledu Thimothi watjidusiwa mujele, hapa kuli kuti watjimbidza swika ndowhohha naye ndiwhomubona.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Mubuyise batungamili bose nebayengemali bose. Banobva kuIthali banomubuyisa.<verse eid="HEB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Ngoni ngadzibe namwi mose. Akujalo.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>